{# BJJ Principle Template V3 - Jinja2 #}
{# Generates markdown from TEMPLATE.json for abstract principles/principles #}
{# A/B Testing: variant-a-show/variant-b-hide CSS classes #}

---
title: "{{name}} | BJJ Principle | BJJ Graph"
description: "{{description}}"
---

{# PostHog A/B Testing Metadata #}
<body data-content-type="principles" data-sections='["overview","building-blocks","prerequisites","where-to-apply","how-to-apply","mistakes-to-avoid","how-to-practice","progress-markers","related"]'>

<!-- Schema Markup - Auto-generated from JSON -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "HowTo",
  "name": "How to Apply {{name}} in BJJ",
  "description": "Decision framework for applying {{name}}.",
  "step": [
    {%- for step in decision_framework[:6] %}
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "{{step.decision_point}}",
      "text": "{{step.action}}",
      "position": {{loop.index}}
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "description": "{{description}}",
  "url": "https://bjjgraph.org/Principles/{{name.replace(' ', '-')}}",
  "isPartOf": {
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "name": "BJJ Graph",
    "url": "https://bjjgraph.org"
  }
}
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/"},
    {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Principles", "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/Principles/"},
    {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "{{name}}", "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/Principles/{{name.replace(' ', '-')}}"}
  ]
}
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- for error in common_errors[:6] %}
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is a common mistake in {{error.error}}?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "{{error.consequence}} The correction is: {{error.correction}}"
      }
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>

{# Debug mode indicator #}
{% if debug_mode %}
<!--
  🐛 BJJ Graph A/B Testing Debug Mode (Concept)

  Content Type: principles
  Section Count: 9
  Week Seed: {{ week_seed }}
  Visual Variant: {{ visual_elements }}

  Generated: {{ generation_timestamp }}
-->
{% endif %}

> {{name}} is a {{complexity_level|lower}} complexity BJJ principle applicable at the {{application_level}} level. Develop over {{development_timeline}}.

**Principle ID**: {{principle_id}}
**Application Level**: {{application_level}}
**Complexity**: {{complexity_level}}
**Development Timeline**: {{development_timeline}}

{# Flexbox wrapper for A/B testing #}
<main class="content-wrapper" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">

<section id="overview" class="content-section">

## What is {{name}}?

{{overview}}

</section>

<section id="building-blocks" class="content-section">

## Building Blocks
{% for principle in key_principles -%}
- {{principle}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="prerequisites" class="content-section">

## Prerequisites
{% for skill in component_skills -%}
**{{skill.skill_name}}**: {{skill.description}}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="where-to-apply" class="content-section">

## Where to Apply
{% for context in application_contexts -%}
**{{context.context}}**: {{context.how_applied}}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="how-to-apply" class="content-section">

## How to Apply
{% for step in decision_framework -%}
{{step.step_number}}. **{{step.decision_point}}**: {{step.action}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="mistakes-to-avoid" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## Mistakes to Avoid
{% for error in common_errors -%}
- **Mistake**: {{error.error}}
  - **Consequence**: {{error.consequence}}
  - **Correction**: {{error.correction}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="how-to-practice" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## How to Practice
{% for approach in training_approaches -%}
**{{approach.approach_name}}** (Focus: {{approach.focus}})
{{approach.description}}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="progress-markers" class="content-section">

## Progress Markers
{% for metric in developmental_metrics -%}
**{{metric.level}} Level**:
{% for behavior in metric.observable_behaviors -%}
- {{behavior}}
{% endfor %}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="related" class="content-section">

## Related

### Related Principles
{% for rel in principle_relationships -%}
- **[[{{rel.principle_name}}]]** ({{rel.relationship_type}}): {{rel.description}}
{% endfor %}

### Related Content
{% for item in related_content -%}
- [[{{item.name}}]] ({{item.content_type}}) - {{item.relationship}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

</main>
